OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm so happy girls can wear
OL,4,Atrousers to school'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents and politicians have been
OL,7,Fwelcoming a change in legislation that
OL,8,Fwill mean girls in Northern Ireland are
OL,9,Fto be given the legal right to wear
OL,10,Ftrousers in school.
OL,12,FRevising guidelines, Education Minister
OL,13,FPaul Givan said that, from the start of
OL,14,Fthe 2027/2028 academic year, schools
OL,15,Fwill be banned from prohibiting girls
OL,16,Fwearing trousers.
OL,18,FYear 13 pupil Connie Rogers has
OL,19,Fwelcomed the change saying "girls
OL,20,Fshould be able to wear trousers" if
OL,21,Fthey want to.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
